        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a game where you sort falling red and blue chicks to the left or right with a single button.<br>Sometimes the colors or order may switch unexpectedly.<br>Some stages are extremely difficult, but there’s an AI assist feature.<br>Each time you play, the AI gets smarter, so anyone can eventually clear it.<br>Accessibility options allow you to adjust contrast and color tones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998650/extras/713f31991269ed73faf8af7107adc9ca.avif?t=1758900365\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998650/extras/229c56c3e37ea481faa5ba6c4e89de67.avif?t=1758900365\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998650/extras/6256d004ce46656d5058395fa0d932d9.avif?t=1758900365\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998650/extras/170c005017680797c4bca5198c45f62b.avif?t=1758900365\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
